Arcjet PHP SDK

This package ports selected functionality from the Arcjet Python SDK:
https://github.com/arcjet/arcjet-py

Reference revision: 498b28b17ebc1a652974ab8ae98c60604e892095

The upstream project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
A copy of that license is included in LICENSE.

Porting changes include PHP 8.4+ APIs, PSR-based HTTP transport and logging,
and a feature scope limited to Bot Protection, Shield WAF, and IP Analysis.
The upstream Python runtime, framework adapters, and WASM binaries are not
distributed as part of this PHP package.

